#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:9
msgid ""
"This is the documentation for Cadrumo and its `aeat` command-line "
"interface (CLI). Cadrumo turns your records into checked modelo figures "
"and an export file. You upload that file to the Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria (AEAT) yourself. For what Cadrumo is and who it"
" is for, see the [product page](https://cadrumo.neve.md); the source is "
"on [GitHub](https://github.com/nevenincs/cadrumo). Cadrumo is in beta - "
"interfaces may still change between releases."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta és la documentació de Cadrumo i de la seva interfície de línia "
"d'ordres (CLI) `aeat`. Cadrumo converteix els teus registres en xifres de"
" modelo comprovades i un fitxer d'exportació. Ets tu qui puja aquest "
"fitxer a l'Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT). El codi "
"font és a [GitHub](https://github.com/nevenincs/cadrumo). Cadrumo està en"
" fase beta; les interfícies encara poden canviar entre versions."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:18
msgid ""
"Cadrumo is not tax advice, is not affiliated with AEAT, and does not "
"replace AEAT's official tools or advice from a qualified professional. It"
" builds, checks, and exports files locally. You file through official "
"AEAT channels yourself and remain responsible for every declaration you "
"submit. Read the [full disclaimer](disclaimer.md) before you rely on "
"Cadrumo."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo no és assessorament fiscal, no està afiliat a l'AEAT i no "
"substitueix les eines oficials de l'AEAT ni l'assessorament d'un "
"professional qualificat. Construeix, comprova i exporta fitxers "
"localment. Ets tu qui presenta pels canals oficials de l'AEAT i continues"
" sent responsable de cada declaració que presentes. Llegeix l'[avís legal"
" complet](disclaimer.md) abans de confiar en Cadrumo."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:25
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "Per on començar"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:27
msgid ""
"These guides cover the whole preparation cycle: setting up a taxpayer "
"profile, importing and classifying bank records, checking what is due, "
"and preparing, verifying, and exporting each modelo. The two worked years"
" - one for income tax, one for IVA - walk the full cycle with real "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"Aquestes guies cobreixen tot el cicle de preparació: configurar un perfil"
" de contribuent, importar i classificar registres bancaris, comprovar què"
" s'ha de presentar, i preparar, verificar i exportar cada modelo. Els dos"
" anys de mostra (un per a l'IRPF i un per a l'IVA) recorren tot el cicle "
"amb ordres reals."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:37
msgid "Start from scratch"
msgstr "Comença de zero"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:42
msgid "Take the shortest path from an empty profile to an exported modelo file."
msgstr "Fes el camí més curt d'un perfil buit a un fitxer de modelo exportat."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:45
msgid "Run through the income-tax year"
msgstr "Recorre l'any de l'IRPF"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:50
msgid ""
"Follow a worked year of Modelo 130 quarters closing into the annual "
"Modelo 100 Renta declaration, command by command."
msgstr ""
"Segueix un any de mostra de trimestres del Modelo 130 que es tanquen en "
"la declaració anual del Modelo 100 (Renta), ordre per ordre."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:54
msgid "Run through the IVA year"
msgstr "Recorre l'any de l'IVA"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:59
msgid ""
"Follow a worked year of Modelo 303 quarters, the Modelo 349 branch, and "
"the annual Modelo 390 summary, command by command."
msgstr ""
"Segueix un any de mostra de trimestres del Modelo 303, la branca del "
"Modelo 349 i el resum anual del Modelo 390, ordre per ordre."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:63
msgid "Set up your taxpayer profile"
msgstr "Configura el teu perfil de contribuent"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:68
msgid ""
"Create the taxpayer profile and record the facts that decide which "
"modelos apply."
msgstr ""
"Crea el perfil de contribuent i registra les dades que determinen quins "
"modelos s'apliquen."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:72
msgid "Import and manage transactions"
msgstr "Importa i gestiona les transaccions"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:77
msgid ""
"Import bank statements, review the rows, and attach the evidence behind "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Importa extractes bancaris, revisa les files i adjunta les proves que hi "
"ha al darrere."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:86
msgid ""
"Decide business, personal, or mixed use and set the category and tax "
"fields on each row."
msgstr ""
"Decideix l'ús comercial, personal o mixt i defineix la categoria i els "
"camps fiscals de cada fila."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:90
msgid "Plan your filing calendar"
msgstr "Planifica el teu calendari de presentacions"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:95
msgid "See which modelos are due and which period to prepare next."
msgstr ""
"Consulta quins modelos s'han de presentar i quin període has de preparar "
"tot seguit."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:98
msgid "Prepare your filings"
msgstr "Prepara les teves presentacions"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:103
msgid ""
"Prepare, verify, export, file at AEAT, and reconcile - with a recipe per "
"modelo: 036, 100 (Renta), 130, 303, 349, and 390."
msgstr ""
"Prepara, verifica, exporta, presenta a l'AEAT i concilia, amb una recepta"
" per a cada modelo: 036, 100 (Renta), 130, 303, 349 i 390."

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:108
msgid "Search everything"
msgstr "Cerca-ho tot"

#: Y:/code/cadrumo-worktrees/main/docs/index.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Press {kbd}`Ctrl+K` ({kbd}`Cmd+K` on macOS) on any page to search tax "
"concepts, casillas, commands, and guides; exact term matches appear "
"first. Use the [command-line reference](cli/index.rst) for commands and "
"options, and [how it works](explanation/index.md) for how records become "
"modelo figures and what checks run. Use [Import, export, and "
"evidence](reference/import-export-and-evidence.md) to distinguish source "
"data, review outputs, AEAT upload files, official filing proof, and audit"
" packages."
msgstr ""
"Prem {kbd}`Ctrl+K` ({kbd}`Cmd+K` a macOS) a qualsevol pàgina per cercar "
"conceptes fiscals, caselles, ordres i guies; les coincidències exactes de"
" terme apareixen primer. Utilitza la [referència de línia "
"d'ordres](cli/index.rst) per a ordres i opcions, i [com "
"funciona](explanation/index.md) per veure com els registres es "
"converteixen en xifres de modelo i quines comprovacions s'executen. "
"Utilitza [Importació, exportació i proves](reference/import-export-and-"
"evidence.md) per distingir les dades d'origen, les sortides de revisió, "
"els fitxers de pujada de l'AEAT, el justificant oficial de presentació i "
"els paquets d'auditoria."

